OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely cloudy day with a few
OL,6,Fshowers, these perhaps wintry at
OL,7,Ftimes. A few bright or sunny intervals
OL,8,Fbetween showers. It will be a cold day.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FRemaining mostly cloudy into
OL,11,Fthe evening with showers and a few
OL,12,Fclear intervals possible. Showers
OL,13,Feasing overnight for Shetland, though
OL,14,Fcontinuing across Orkney. Northerly
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA few showers to start the
OL,18,Fday. These mostly dying in the morning
OL,19,Fto leave a dry, cold and bright
OL,20,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
